    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_5",
      "quote": "Records were eligible for inclusion if they met the following criteria: - (i) the use of at least one POC testing device assessing NCD measures... POC testing was considered across multiple contexts, including adult care, paediatric care, self-managed testing, clinic-based testing, or community health settings; - (ii) reporting of at least one measure related to health literacy... - (iii) health literacy of individuals aged 10 + years... - (iv) full-text peer reviewed journal article published within the five years prior to the search. Studies were excluded if they were reviews of peerreviewed studies. The five-year limit was applied... No restrictions on the type of study design, sample size, or language of manuscript were imposed.",
      "reason": "The manuscript explicitly lists inclusion and exclusion criteria, covering the intervention (POC testing), outcomes (health literacy), population (age 10+), and study characteristics (peer-reviewed, 5-year limit, no design/language restrictions)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_5",
      "quote": "Records were eligible for inclusion if they met the following criteria: ... (iv) full-text peer reviewed journal article published within the five years prior to the search. ... No restrictions on the type of study design, sample size, or language of manuscript were imposed.",
      "reason": "The manuscript specifies the dissemination timeframe (five years prior to search), publication status (peer-reviewed), and explicitly states there were no language restrictions."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The manuscript does not describe excluding studies specifically because outcomes were not measured versus not reported; this level of detail regarding exclusion reasons is not applicable to the reported methodology."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_16",
      "quote": "To address the research question, six studies adopted a qualitative approach, six utilised quantitative methods, and one used mixed methods (Table 1). All outcomes were treated as proxy measures of health literacy or",
      "reason": "The manuscript specifies how studies were grouped for synthesis (qualitative, quantitative, mixed methods) and links these to the research objectives (proxy measures of health literacy)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_5",
      "quote": "The five-year limit was applied in line with WHO guidance to capture contemporary evidence on POC testing and health literacy, reflecting advances in diagnostic technologies and evolving definitions of health literacy.",
      "reason": "The manuscript provides a clear rationale for the restriction on the publication date (five-year limit)."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 100
}

